      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِمَّانٌ</span></b>  The <i>decorations,</i> or <i>embellishments,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزَاوِيق</span>,) <i>of a ceiling:</i> so says IAar; and in like
